type: software
title: "Verification artifacts for Cubic children and two-band inertia in near-extremal C4-free graphs"
abstract: >-
  Two independent Python verification implementations and a Lean
  formalization for the algebraic identities, moment expansions, threshold
  inequalities, asymptotic coefficients, and diagnostic values used in the
  associated manuscript.
